{"unit_id":"B635__dsh-split-view#card-zh","repo":"B635/dsh-split-view","commit":"2a870becbcdf9b7f25c33a96fadd485c22ea5160","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Session Split View 是一个面向 Web 和桌面客户端的 DSH 会话分栏插件：它在主界面注册独立的分栏面板，把两个会话及各自的对话内容和输入区并排显示。用户可以为左右栏分别选择会话，拖动分隔条调整宽度，交换两栏或将栏内会话切回主会话；会话包含 Agent Teams 时，还能查看成员和共享任务并在栏内切换成员。适合需要同时查看或操作两个 DSH 会话、比较会话进展或跟进团队成员工作的用户。分栏选择和宽度会保存在浏览器本地，不需要额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:914-1104","client.js:1161-1305","client.js:256-288"]}
{"unit_id":"B635__dsh-split-view#card-en","repo":"B635/dsh-split-view","commit":"2a870becbcdf9b7f25c33a96fadd485c22ea5160","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Session Split View displays two DSH sessions side by side in a web or desktop panel. Choose a session for each pane, resize or swap panes, and open a pane in the main conversation. Agent Teams members and shared tasks are available there. Session choices and width are saved in browser storage.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:914-1104","client.js:1161-1305","client.js:256-288"]}
