{"unit_id":"B635__dsh-split-view#feature-1","repo":"B635/dsh-split-view","commit":"2a870becbcdf9b7f25c33a96fadd485c22ea5160","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Session Split View 的功能「双会话并排」：在主面板同时呈现左右两个会话。每栏使用各自的会话引用和对话内容区域，可分别查看和输入。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:850-911","client.js:1077-1104"]}
{"unit_id":"B635__dsh-split-view#feature-2","repo":"B635/dsh-split-view","commit":"2a870becbcdf9b7f25c33a96fadd485c22ea5160","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Session Split View 的功能「独立选择会话」：点击栏头会话名打开列表，为该栏选择要显示的会话；如果选择另一栏正在显示的会话，插件会交换两栏内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:869-877","client.js:940-954"]}
{"unit_id":"B635__dsh-split-view#feature-3","repo":"B635/dsh-split-view","commit":"2a870becbcdf9b7f25c33a96fadd485c22ea5160","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Session Split View 的功能「调整分栏宽度」：拖动两栏之间的分隔条可改变左右宽度，键盘方向键也可微调；双击分隔条恢复均分。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1002-1065","client.js:1093-1104"]}
{"unit_id":"B635__dsh-split-view#feature-4","repo":"B635/dsh-split-view","commit":"2a870becbcdf9b7f25c33a96fadd485c22ea5160","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Session Split View 的功能「查看团队成员」：会话关联 Agent Teams 时，可打开团队面板查看成员和共享任务，并在当前栏切换到成员会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:758-805","client.js:956-969"]}
{"unit_id":"B635__dsh-split-view#feature-5","repo":"B635/dsh-split-view","commit":"2a870becbcdf9b7f25c33a96fadd485c22ea5160","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Session Split View 的功能「记住分栏状态」：插件将两栏的会话选择和宽度比例保存到浏览器本地存储，之后打开分栏页时恢复。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:22-22","client.js:256-295"]}
{"unit_id":"B635__dsh-split-view#caveat-1","repo":"B635/dsh-split-view","commit":"2a870becbcdf9b7f25c33a96fadd485c22ea5160","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Session Split View 使用浏览器 localStorage 记住两栏会话和宽度；清除该站点本地数据会重置分栏状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:22-22","client.js:256-288"]}
